# US Stock Technical Analysis Bot

Rule-based technical analysis for US stocks/ETFs with a Streamlit + Plotly UI, alerts, a risk calculator and a
conservative backtester. **Educational/research use only. Not financial advice, not a profit predictor.**

## What is in this version

| Page | What it does |
|---|---|
| Home | Market status, last signals, shortcuts |
| Live scanner | Two-stage screen (daily price/liquidity, then 1-minute features), 0-100 explainable score, lifecycle states, Telegram alerts, news/catalyst check, "has this pattern happened before?" |
| Company history | Full price history since the data starts, drawdowns/surges/gaps/reversals, SEC filings matched by type and timing, annual financials, HTML report |
| Technical analysis | The original chart, indicators, 11 rule setups, risk calculator, backtest, watchlist alerts |
| Journal & testing | Every signal is stored (including failures), outcome tracking, strict replay backtest with baselines, calibration gate |
| Settings & status | Editable thresholds/weights, source status (keys never shown), Telegram test, run log |

