## Troubleshooting

- *"Provider returned no data"*: wrong ticker, holiday, or Yahoo rate limiting. Wait a minute or scan fewer tickers.
- *Scanner finds nothing*: normal outside market hours and often during it; the scanner does not invent signals.
- *"fewer than 3 prior sessions: liquidity unknown"*: the provider returned too little 1-minute history for that name.
- *SEC features off*: set `SEC_USER_AGENT` in `.env` and restart the app.
- *Import errors*: run from the project root with the virtualenv active.

## Known limitations / future work

Free delayed data only; no sector-relative strength (needs a sector map); catalyst tags are keyword hints; weights and
thresholds are starting points that must be judged only on sessions not used to tune them; no automatic order execution
(deliberately out of scope).
